💼 Career Center – Foundation (Life Progression System)

---

🌍 Career Center

Career Center sirf ek building nahi hai.

Ye DreamVerse ki ek poori jagah (Area) hai.

Is area ke andar future me alag-alag places hongi.

- 🏢 Career Center Main Building
- 🎓 College
- 🏋️ Training Areas
- 💼 Job Areas
- 🧪 Practical Areas
- 🌍 Future Career Places

---

👶 Life Start

Player ke paas 2 options honge.

👶 Birth as Baby

Life shuru hogi:

Baby → School → College → Degree → Job → Promotion.

🎓 Continue Existing Career

Agar player ke account me pehle se degree hai,

to wo seedha us career me continue kar sakta hai.

---

🎓 Degree System ⭐

DreamVerse Golden Rule

Degree kabhi delete nahi hogi.

Chahe:

- New Life
- Career Change
- Dusra Server
- Dusra Country

Degree permanently account me save rahegi.

Degree = Permanent Key.

Player jab chahe us degree wali job dobara join kar sakta hai.

---

📖 Previous Life

Player New Life karega.

Purani life history ban jayegi.

News me bhi aa sakta hai:

«"Dr. Shubh ki life complete ho gayi."»

Player delete nahi hoga.

Sirf nayi life shuru hogi.

---

🎂 Birthday System

Player jis real date ko New Life start karega,

wahi uska DreamVerse Birthday hoga.

Example:

Join Date → 30 July

Har saal → 30 July Birthday.

---

⏳ Age Progression

Age sirf tab badhegi

jab player online hoga.

Offline time me age nahi badhegi.

---

🧊 Time Capsule

Career Center Area me Time Capsule hogi.

Player andar ja sakta hai.

- Age pause.
- Character safe.
- Baad me wahi age se continue.

---

💀 Maximum Age

Har life ki maximum age:

100 Years

Uske baad:

- Natural Death
- Ya New Life

---

🌟 Immortality

Bahut difficult unlock hoga.

Research + Knowledge + Rare Missions complete karne par.

Immortal player age ki wajah se nahi marega.

---

❤️ Real Life System

Pure DreamVerse me:

- 🍞 Bhookh
- 💧 Pyaas
- 😴 Neend
- 🤒 Bimari
- 🩹 Injury
- 🩸 Blood Loss

sab hoga.

---

🩹 Damage System

Building se kudne, accident ya injury par:

- Pair toot sakta hai.
- Khoon nikal sakta hai.
- Serious injury ho sakti hai.

Real-life style damage.

---

👁️ HUD Rule

Screen par:

❌ Hunger Bar

❌ Thirst Bar

❌ Health Bar

Player khud feel karega.

Example:

- Bhookh lagegi.
- Chalna slow hoga.
- Pair tootega.
- Khoon niklega.
- Neend aayegi.

---

🩸 Injury Effects

- Pair toot gaya.
- Khoon beh raha hai.
- Body weak.
- Vision blur.
- Heartbeat tez.
- Chalna mushkil.

---

👤 First Person

First Person me:

- Puri body dikhegi.
- Pair dikhenge.
- Haath dikhenge.
- Height ke hisaab se eye level badhega.

Mirror me player apni body dekh sakega.

---

☠️ Death Rule

🌍 DreamVerse ke baaki Areas

Death → Respawn.

💼 Career Center Area

Death → Current Life End.

Player New Life choose karega.

